loli (1.0.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * UI polish: animated sidebar collapse, slim scrollbars across all scroll
    areas, :pressed/:disabled button states, busy feedback (button disabled +
    "…") on service Start/Stop/Restart/Install, and corrected stray Flat-UI
    accent colours in the system-resource panel.
  * Fix dark-mode bugs: tray-menu icons now follow the desktop palette (they
    were dark and invisible on a dark menu), and the Logs page tab bar gets
    explicit colours so its text stays readable in dark mode.
  * Fix UI flicker on rapid window resize by dropping the per-card drop-shadow
    graphics effect in favour of a lightweight styled border.

 -- s4rt4 <surat.sarta@gmail.com>  Wed, 17 Jun 2026 07:34:23 +0700

loli (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sidebar can now collapse to an icon-only rail (toggle at the top); the nav
    menu scrolls so the system-resource bars stay pinned and never overlap.
  * Fix dashboard service-status action buttons (Start/Stop/Restart) stretching
    wide when the sidebar is collapsed.

 -- s4rt4 <surat.sarta@gmail.com>  Sat, 13 Jun 2026 18:20:00 +0700

loli (1.0.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package (native). Mirrors the RPM layout: app under
    /usr/share/loli, launcher at /usr/bin/loli, .desktop and scalable icon.
  * Distro is auto-detected at runtime (loli/platform_spec.py); on Debian the
    panel drives apache2, redis-server, apt, a2enmod/a2ensite and per-version
    PHP via update-alternatives.

 -- s4rt4 <surat.sarta@gmail.com>  Sat, 13 Jun 2026 12:45:59 +0700
